Xiong Jiao Man (also referred to as Xiong Jian Man) is the character who famously appears to die twice due to a continuity and plotting error in Reverend Insanity. [1, 2]

The Continuity Error Details





First Death (Chapter 189): The character is seemingly decapitated by Bai Ning Bing during the clashes at the qing mao mountain / clan conflicts.



Second Death (Chapter 194): Just five chapters later, she reappears active in the plot only to be killed yet again, creating a notable oversight by the author Gu Zhen Ren.



Community Reception: Fans on discussion spaces like the Reverend Insanity Fandom note that because she is a minor side character, the continuity slip went unedited and uncorrected in the final release. [1]

